WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.860
Welcome to the Graveyard.

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:06.250
Please, keep your voices down, it’s a very
somber place.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.330
You can feel the sadness here.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.330
The pain.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.760
The things left unsaid.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:15.210
In that sense, it’s not unlike every other
graveyard all across the world.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:20.810
But of course, we wouldn’t be covering it
here if it was just any graveyard, would we?

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:25.869
The eagle-eyed among you may notice that we’re
walking through a military cemetery, for starters.

00:00:25.869 --> 00:00:30.749
But the people buried here aren’t the martyrs
of any war your history teacher would tell

00:00:30.749 --> 00:00:31.869
you about.

00:00:31.869 --> 00:00:36.829
The people and entities interred here, fought
their wars in the shadows.

00:00:36.829 --> 00:00:41.329
They died in the dark so we could live in
the light.

00:00:41.329 --> 00:00:42.940
But who are they?

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:44.899
What is this place?

00:00:44.899 --> 00:00:47.300
Who are the people buried here, really?

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.629
To find that out, we need to take a step back.

00:00:51.629 --> 00:00:53.309
It began in Site-43.

00:00:53.309 --> 00:00:59.969
Specifically, Laboratory 37 of Site-43’s
Artificial Intelligence Wing.

00:00:59.969 --> 00:01:04.850
Researchers were conducting a series of tests
on a few classified artificial intelligence

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:09.740
anomalies, with the help of a Foundation-made
Artificial Intelligence Construct known as

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:10.740
Marvin.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:16.000
However, what was meant to be a set of routine
cognition tests turned into a mass containment

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.400
breach believed to be coordinated by several
of the rogue AIs involved.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.290
Things went sideways quickly.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:27.940
The breach resulted in the deaths of three
members of security personnel and it was only

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:32.830
stopped when Marvin and a more benevolent
anomaly worked together to get things back

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:33.830
under control.

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:39.500
While their efforts were valiant, they weren’t
enough to save Marvin himself, who was rendered

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.860
inoperable during the breach.

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:47.010
All the copies of the anomalous AIs were neutralized
after testing was complete.

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:51.150
Under the orders of the Site Director, the
remaining materials relating to Marvin and

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:55.320
the neutralized anomalies were left in Laboratory
37.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.590
Things appeared to be returning to normal
until maintenance personnel entered the lab

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:00.920
later that day.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:06.510
You can undeniably encounter some pretty strange
things inside an SCP Foundation laboratory

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:11.160
- it comes with the territory - but when you
walk into a lab and find yourself standing

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:16.560
in a giant military ceremony, it’s probably
time to contact your supervisors and let them

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:17.560
know.

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:22.140
While those maintenance workers didn’t truly
comprehend what they’d discovered, the Foundation

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:27.090
researchers who got involved shortly afterward
were able to take in the full scope of it:

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:33.550
An ever-expanding extra-dimensional graveyard,
seeming to exist outside of space and time

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:39.800
as we understand it - Which soon became known
to the Foundation as SCP-2783.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:46.400
The cemetery is believed to currently contain
over a million graves - That’s over double

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.950
the mere 400,000 buried at Arlington National
Cemetery.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:56.690
These graves are meticulously arranged into
huge square grids, each one containing around

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:59.330
90,000 graves apiece.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:05.260
This would be peculiar enough in its own right,
but things get a whole lot stranger.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:10.319
Each grave is clearly marked with a name and
an epitaph, but ground-penetrating radar tests

00:03:10.319 --> 00:03:15.230
conducted by the Foundation revealed that
only 30% of the graves actually contain human

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:19.870
remains, and the remaining 70% are currently
empty.

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:24.550
And considering that the number of graves
actually seems to be increasing at an arbitrary

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:29.970
rate, it isn’t difficult to draw the conclusion
that some event in the near future is destined

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:32.800
to fill these empty graves.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:38.990
Perhaps a war like one we’ve never seen
is on the horizon, and SCP-2783 is growing

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:42.709
in preparation to house its teeming casualties.

00:03:42.709 --> 00:03:44.810
Death is a funny thing.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:51.190
It can have varied and unpredictable faces
in the eyes of its beholders, and the great

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:55.250
SCP-2783 cemetery is no exception to this
rule.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:04:00.670
It appears slightly different to all who view
it, even when viewing it at the same time.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:05.830
Factors like climate and weather are dictated
by the place of a person’s origin.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:11.430
The same goes for the style of the grave markers:
They seem to be culturally specific to a beholder’s

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:15.790
view of what a military grave marker tends
to look like, and the epitaphs are written

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:19.099
in the native language of whoever sees them.

00:04:19.099 --> 00:04:21.669
It is a truly universal cemetery.

00:04:21.669 --> 00:04:27.400
A place where anyone and everyone can come
and grieve the courageous fallen with equal

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:29.699
understanding and respect.

00:04:29.699 --> 00:04:34.160
The Foundation has been able to use GPS tracking
to locate the graveyard’s equivalent on

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:38.310
our planet, tracing it back to an ancient
tomb in Southern Iraq.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:43.530
There, the Foundation collaborated with the
ORIA - the Organization for the Reclamation

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:46.910
of Islamic Artifacts - to investigate further.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:51.840
The mission discovered a number of artifacts
belonging to several previously undocumented

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:57.490
pre-Mesopotamian civilizations but failed
to uncover any physical evidence of SCP-2783

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.289
at this site.

00:04:59.289 --> 00:05:05.030
The cemetery is marked off by a fence that
seems impossible to penetrate.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:09.960
Those who walk through the door in Laboratory
37 manifest just outside of a gate built into

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:10.960
the fence.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:15.330
However, any attempt to walk back through
this gate will simply lead to the subject

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.539
exiting back through the doors to Laboratory
37.

00:05:18.539 --> 00:05:23.289
Thankfully, for any Foundation staff who left
something they actually needed in Laboratory

00:05:23.289 --> 00:05:29.520
37, the teleportation does not affect machines,
so remote-controlled robots can still be sent

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:31.069
into the lab.

00:05:31.069 --> 00:05:37.199
Shortly after discovering SCP-2783, reconnaissance
teams were sent in to start cataloging the

00:05:37.199 --> 00:05:38.490
grave markings.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:42.870
As concerning information started to pour
in, the Foundation upped the security clearance

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:48.110
on both physical and informational access
to SCP-2783.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:53.259
Nobody below Level 5 Security Clearance is
able to see the full picture.

00:05:53.259 --> 00:05:54.259
So…

00:05:54.259 --> 00:05:56.039
What is the full picture?

00:05:56.039 --> 00:06:00.759
Well, at the risk of getting assassinated
by the Red Right Hand, let’s take a look

00:06:00.759 --> 00:06:04.979
at the few recorded grave markers and see
if we can find out…

00:06:04.979 --> 00:06:12.830
Take grave AA-00000, inscribed with the name
“YHWH” - a potential shortening of the

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:17.169
name “Yahweh”, a common alias of the Abrahamic
God.

00:06:17.169 --> 00:06:21.469
The epitaph on the grave reads, “He was
vital in Her Construction.

00:06:21.469 --> 00:06:24.659
His Design shall prove vital in Her Reconstruction.”

00:06:24.659 --> 00:06:29.789
However, there are multiple variants of this
grave, and while all seem to memorialize some

00:06:29.789 --> 00:06:35.099
kind of creator deity, there seems to be no
favoritism of any particular type of deity

00:06:35.099 --> 00:06:38.599
or any specific religious denomination.

00:06:38.599 --> 00:06:42.210
Sightings of variants of this gravestone have
reached the double digits.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:50.639
Then there’s grave AA-00002, marked Hawwah
Bat Asherah, also known as Eve, the First

00:06:50.639 --> 00:06:51.639
Woman.

00:06:51.639 --> 00:06:57.319
Her grave marking reads, “The Serpent within
the Library bestowed upon her great Wisdom.

00:06:57.319 --> 00:07:01.719
Her loss inspires us all to seek wisdom in
this, the Living World.”

00:07:01.719 --> 00:07:10.409
It’s believed by some that Asherah was the
mother of Cain and Able, SCP-073 and SCP-076,

00:07:10.409 --> 00:07:16.490
and also spent a period of time as O5-1, wishing
to guide humanity in the right direction.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:25.840
How about grave AA-00005, marked Lilit Bat
YHWH, also known as SCP-336.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.990
Her epitaph reads “She was loved greatly.

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:31.399
Her beauty will not be forgotten.”

00:07:31.399 --> 00:07:36.550
According to Foundation records, Lilith is
a beautiful humanoid woman with reptilian

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:42.159
legs, whose enchanting voice has the power
to induce infertility in women and a combination

00:07:42.159 --> 00:07:47.819
of comas and anomalous tumors in men - anomalous
in the sense that they will birth vicious,

00:07:47.819 --> 00:07:49.300
deadly chimeras.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:54.720
Next, grave AA-00006, marked Set Ben Adam.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:59.479
His epitaph reads, “This graveyard was constructed
under his orders.

00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:04.889
When those interred here rise again, it is
under his command they shall fight.”

00:08:04.889 --> 00:08:12.449
Set, or Seth, is also known as SCP-4840-A,
a powerful sibling of Cain and Able living

00:08:12.449 --> 00:08:13.929
in SCP-4840.

00:08:13.929 --> 00:08:21.689
How, when, or why he decided to order the
construction of SCP-2783 is unknown.

00:08:21.689 --> 00:08:27.409
Then, grave AB-21917, marked Unknown.

00:08:27.409 --> 00:08:32.839
Their epitaph reads, “A Crafter of the FLESH
and a disciple of the Tongueless Speaker.

00:08:32.839 --> 00:08:38.969
A worthy foe; his precious moments were expended
on the hordes of the Crimson Crown and so

00:08:38.969 --> 00:08:42.779
he is memorialized among the heroes of the
People.”

00:08:42.779 --> 00:08:47.630
Radars of the grave showed that the creature
interred within had biology atypical of a

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.630
human.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:53.110
Our interpretation of the epitaph is that
this was a follower of Sarkicism, the worship

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:58.380
of the flesh, who worked with the Church of
the Broken God and the SCP Foundation to fight

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:03.050
against the Scarlet King, and died a hero
as a result.

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:08.980
Next, grave AL-21343 - believed to belong
to Dr. Sophia Light.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:14.630
Her epitaph reads, “Our Savior and Prophet,
our Staff and Shepard.

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:21.029
The Machine Goddess smiled upon this house,
and even now, those who rest here are tended

00:09:21.029 --> 00:09:22.029
to.”

00:09:22.029 --> 00:09:26.410
This is one of the many references to the
Machine or Clockwork Goddess, an alternate

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:31.020
title for Mekhane, the deity of the Church
of the Broken God.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:35.850
Evidence suggests that this cemetery was the
work of the Church and that all who are interred

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:41.089
there were or are going to be aligned with
the Broken God in the struggle against a far

00:09:41.089 --> 00:09:43.529
greater threat to us all.

00:09:43.529 --> 00:09:51.230
Next, AL-30056, marked Nicholas Flamel, with
the epitaph, “An esteemed scholar who rose

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:55.430
to great heights, but, like Icarus, fell from
great heights.”

00:09:55.430 --> 00:10:00.100
While, mythologically, Flamel is believed
to have been an alchemist and creator of the

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:05.209
legendary philosopher’s stone, the Foundation
hasn’t detected any confirmed anomalous

00:10:05.209 --> 00:10:07.430
activity connected to him.

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:15.420
Of much greater interest to fans of this channel
we come upon AL-41867, marked Lord Theodore

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:20.790
Thomas Blackwood, his epitaph reading, “His
service to the advancement of Science and

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.930
Humanity shall carry on.”

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:28.470
A full-sized human skeleton lays in the grave,
so perhaps Lord Blackwood’s service did

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.940
carry on, just in a different body…

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.580
Then came the grave of Pvt.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:39.509
Pyotr Avtukhov, whose epitaph reads, “He
and his fellows have seen the gates of Hell.

00:10:39.509 --> 00:10:43.790
Though they do not deserve it, they shall
be first to greet the hordes of the Crimson

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:46.129
Crown when the Gates open.”

00:10:46.129 --> 00:10:47.940
Fans of the channel may remember Pvt.

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:53.860
Avtukhov from our coverage of SCP-180: He
was one of the soldiers involved in the horrific

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:57.699
ordeal of the anomalous Battle of Husiatyn
Woods.

00:10:57.699 --> 00:11:04.410
Another name you may recognize is the one
carved into grave marker AM-21450: Doctor

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:05.529
Alto Clef.

00:11:05.529 --> 00:11:09.410
That’s right, everyone’s favorite lovable
loose cannon.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.779
His epitaph reads, “A loving father.

00:11:11.779 --> 00:11:14.949
He gave much more than was demanded of him.”

00:11:14.949 --> 00:11:21.389
The variants of his grave also list his other
aliases: Agent Ukulele and Adam El Asem, the

00:11:21.389 --> 00:11:22.449
First Man.

00:11:22.449 --> 00:11:27.350
The date of his death corresponds with a recorded
near containment breach that resulted in the

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:30.440
deaths of two other members of personnel.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:32.949
Clef cheats death another day…

00:11:32.949 --> 00:11:34.009
For now.

00:11:34.009 --> 00:11:41.180
And the most recent grave, AM-21488, was the
grave of Marvin, the AIC that helped save

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:46.959
the day during the containment breach that
opened the portal to SCP-2783.

00:11:46.959 --> 00:11:52.300
His epitaph reads, “A machine mind that
gave his life to protect his builders, just

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:54.920
as the Machine Goddess before him.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:12:00.180
There will always be a place in Paradise for
those who gave of themselves as he did.”

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:04.959
It’s somewhat heartwarming to know that,
in the eyes of the Clockwork Goddess, a mere

00:12:04.959 --> 00:12:11.839
AI can be revered just as much for heroism
as anyone constructed from flesh and blood.

00:12:11.839 --> 00:12:17.720
Recorded back in 2017 during a routine search,
Agent Phillip McClean saw thirteen humanoid

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:23.100
entities in funeral garb with an insignia
described as “a white circular shield with

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:28.250
three equidistant protrusions; inside the
shield were three equidistant black arrows

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.819
piercing a white circle outlined in black.”

00:12:30.819 --> 00:12:35.879
These entities performed what seemed to be
funeral rites, before committing another body

00:12:35.879 --> 00:12:37.500
to the dirt below.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:43.240
The name on the new grave marker was Captain
Kari Michelle Hollis, Mobile Task Force Zeta

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.240
9.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:50.250
Her epitaph read, “She died in a strange
and faraway place with a smile on her face,

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:54.160
a weapon in her hand, and foes on all sides.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:57.610
She exemplified what all warriors should strive
to be.”

00:12:57.610 --> 00:13:03.550
For those of you that can remember our three-part
series on SCP-1730, you may also remember

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:08.940
that Captain Hollis was the brave MTF leader
who sacrificed her own life in the terrible

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:14.879
bowels of Site-13 to turn on the THRESHER
machine, kicking the whole awful place to

00:13:14.879 --> 00:13:16.410
another dimension.

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:20.079
Here, her heroic sacrifice can never be forgotten.

00:13:20.079 --> 00:13:26.410
While there’s an ominous subtext to a lot
of SCP-2783 - from its predictions of individual

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:31.550
deaths to hints at a bloody war with the Scarlet
King coming down the tracks - there’s something

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:35.129
undeniably beautiful about the idea of this
place.

00:13:35.129 --> 00:13:41.170
We share in the mourning and reverence of
the Clockwork Goddess, of heroes great and

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:44.310
small, gone but never forgotten.

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:50.680
In SCP-2783, no act of courage or sacrifice
will ever be lost to time.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:53.410
Be sure to leave quietly on your way out.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:56.730
Like we said before, this is a somber place.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:14:02.079
Now go check out “SCP 1440 - The Old Man
That Kills All Living Things He Touches”

00:14:02.079 --> 00:14:09.050
and “Evil Monster Created by SCP Foundation
SCP-2419 - The Laughing Men” for more SCPs

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:10.670
linked to death, the final frontier!

